    "synopsis": {
        "native": "A\u00f1os 40, una ciudad cualquiera. Un misterioso extranjero propone a cuatro inseparables amigos, que jugaban a ser una banda, un peligroso trabajo que llevar\u00e1 sus vidas por un camino sin retorno. Ricardo (Francisco Vera), un ambicioso limpiabotas, Amador (Octavi Pujades), un luchador clandestino de bodegas de barco, Marcelo (Domingo de Luis), un maquillador de cad\u00e1veres que iba para contable y Antonio (Borja Elgea), un mec\u00e1nico cuyo mayor defecto eran las mujeres casadas, cambiar\u00e1n para siempre sus vidas al aceptar la tentadora oferta de una vida mejor.",
        "english": "Spain, 1944, a country in turmoil, times are hard. Almost bankrupted by his late father's gambling debts, Ricardo, is forced to scrape a living as a shoe-shine boy, in order to care for his recently widowed sister and to keep them in their family home. Ricardo and his life-long buddies work together as a gang, extracting money from debtors for the town's rich and powerful. When the code of loyalty, that has bonded the four friends for so long, is tested to the limit, it takes them on a terrifying journey into an increasing spiral of violence."
    },
